# {{ plugin_name }}

> AURORAZ plugin scaffolded with `auroraz-sdk init`.

## Develop

```bash
auroraz-sdk validate    # lint manifest + static analyze backend/
auroraz-sdk dev         # run plugin against a local AURORAZ core
auroraz-sdk pack        # build {{ plugin_id }}-0.1.0.azpkg
```

## Layout

- `plugin.yaml` — manifest (id, version, permissions, tools, hooks)
- `backend/main.py` — Python entry point
- `requirements.txt` / `requirements.lock` — pinned deps + hashes
{% if with_ui -%}
- `frontend/Panel.jsx` — optional UI panel
{% endif -%}
